## Refined AC
1. Superseding the 2026-03-21 04:42 tracker note, treat #541 as a historical parent only. Do not move this task to 	odo; the async journal behavior is already implemented and verified by archived task #841 plus live regression tests.
2. The source-of-truth implementation remains in src/owlbear/daemon.py: _log_to_journal() is sync def and delegates journal.log(...) through wait asyncio.to_thread(...).
3. _recover_from_error() in src/owlbear/daemon.py awaits _log_to_journal() at all six call sites, so daemon-side journal writes do not block the event loop directly.
4. ErrorJournal, JsonlStore, and orchestrator/loop_detection.py::_log_to_journal() remain synchronous; async offload is isolated to the daemon call site and introduces no new third-party dependencies.
5. The regression contract remains encoded in 	ests/test_daemon_journal_async.py and 	ests/test_daemon_async_contract.py. If this area regresses, create a new RED/GREEN pair for that regression instead of dispatching builder work from #541.

